 " attaques", "start": 15.48, "end": 15.74}, {"word": " direct.", "start": 15.74, "end": 15.96}]}, {"start": 17.419999999999998, "end": 23.36, "text": " Trois, tes mails et tes messages, c'est à heure fixe, pas au réveil, sinon tu gères les urgences des autres.", "words": [{"word": " Trois,", "start": 17.419999999999998, "end": 17.74}, {"word": " tes", "start": 17.74, "end": 18.06}, {"word": " mails", "start": 18.06, "end": 18.38}, {"word": " et", "start": 18.38, "end": 18.5}, {"word": " tes", "start": 18.5, "end": 18.62}, {"word": " messages,", "start": 18.62, "end": 18.98}, {"word": " c", "start": 19.22, "end": 19.6}, {"word": "'est", "start": 19.6, "end": 19.76}, {"word": " à", "start": 19.76, "end": 19.78}, {"word": " heure", "start": 19.78, "end": 19.96}, {"word": " fixe,", "start": 19.96, "end": 20.42}, {"word": " pas", "start": 20.46, "end": 20.8}, {"word": " au", "start": 20.8, "end": 20.94}, {"word": " réveil,", "start": 20.94, "end": 21.38}, {"word": " sinon", "start": 21.38, "end": 21.9}, {"word": " tu", "start": 21.9, "end": 22.1}, {"word": " gères", "start": 22.1, "end": 22.36}, {"word": " les", "start": 22.36, "end": 22.5}, {"word": " urgences", "start": 22.5, "end": 23.02}, {"word": " des", "start": 23.02, "end": 23.14}, {"word": " autres.", "start": 23.14, "end": 23.36}]}, {"start": 24.68, "end": 27.14, "text": " Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour.", "words": [{"word": " Franchement,", "start": 24.68, "end": 25.0}, {"word": " mise", "start": 25.0, "end": 25.32}, {"word": " bout", "start": 25.32, "end": 25.46}, {"word": " à", "start": 25.46, "end": 25.56}, {"word": " bout,", "start": 25.56, "end": 25.68}, {"word": " ça", "start": 25.76, "end": 26.02}, {"word": " peut", "start": 26.02, "end": 26.16}, {"word": " te", "start": 26.16, "end": 26.24}, {"word": " rendre", "start": 26.24, "end": 26.4}, {"word": " deux", "start": 26.4, "end": 26.62}, {"word": " heures", "start": 26.62, "end": 26.78}, {"word": " par", "start": 26.78, "end": 26.92}, {"word": " jour.", "start": 26.92, "end": 27.14}]}], "text": " Tu ne manques pas que tes gestes en honte si tu ne manques pas de temps.  Tu gaspilles à l'éleveur de ce beurre collègue chaque matin.  Trois habitudes pour les récupérer.  Un pas de téléphone la première heure, parce que juste deux minutes sur une appli, ça finit souvent en une demi-heure.  Deux, tu choisis ta tâche la plus importante la veille.  Comme ça, au réveil, tu attaques direct.  Trois, tes mails et tes messages, c'est à heure fixe, pas au réveil, sinon tu gères les urgences des autres.  Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour."}